  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "台文通訊BONG報328期-編輯室ê話"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: medium;\">30</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">冬前</span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">，有一陣要意台語ê未來ê前輩，決定同齊來創辦台語文雜誌，tsiah有《台文通訊》tī洛杉磯puh-ínn。30年來，伊講文化、sueh歷史、記心情、論科學......，啥mi̍h to有，有濟濟值得收藏ê作品。Uì《台文通訊》到tsit-má ê《台文通訊BONG報》，伊ê多元、自由kap包容，一直lóng無改變。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">台語文雜誌創刊30週年tsit款大代誌，本底應當是ài招逐家做伙來鬧熱--一-下，m̄-koh，受著疫情影響，實體活動bē辦--得，變做線頂ê慶祝會。透過tsit个方式，顛倒kā海內外濟濟台文有志，做一擺lóng箍做伙，仝款鬧熱滾滾！除了看著bē少台語文運動ê sia̋n-pái以外，mā有tsiok濟少年人來參加。有專門講台語議題ê網tshìng、有tī海外開辦台文班ê會長、有成立台語共學團、台語親子友善課程ê爸母，有人搬戲、寫歌、編尪仔冊等等。Mā有立委來關心母語政策ê進展。逐家tī世界各地，用in上gâu ê方式，鬥陣來tshui-sak台語。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">慶祝會講煞，tńg來看tsit期雜誌有啥mih好料？刊冬外ê【台文通訊30週年經典回顧】專欄，討論台語文書寫、文字標準化、對台語文未來發展ê ǹg望，tsit期kā重點lóng整理做一篇。〈Kā阮兜ê夢想，捏做囡仔畫本〉記錄莊佳穎教授出版囡仔古ê過程，母語beh生湠，培養koh-khah濟台語囡仔，是現此時kài重要ê代誌。〈Kah Tâi-bûn ê Iok-hōe〉hōo lán看著少年爸母拍拚學台語ê用心。6--月是畢業ê季節，雖bóng kan-na ē-tàng tī線頂舉辦，台大歷史系ê周婉窈教授用台語致詞，mā借tsit个機會提醒逐家，ài ē-hiáu看世界ê變化，好好仔了解、寶惜台灣ê民主自由。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">以上tsia--ê，hōo lán相信，行過30冬，台語thn̂g湠ê火種m̄-nā iáu未hua--去，koh ē有濟濟人繼續kā點--落-去！Mā ǹg望逐家繼續支持《台文通訊BONG報》kap李江却台語文教基金會，hōo lán做伙kā 寶貴ê語言文化一直傳--落-去。</span></p><p><br /></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi-0X0hNU84R_6xp9UJ9KzIPHP-oWlKAdpHzluJ_ZtphXRAG0C7AzKkM-MK-nucrI0ywX7fcbaBeyl8V_P9iPgLcpUj2G8-xkHYAYEmLTYFfIABtRV1d6vbEFoL3yizBkshcTyoRCvIdfiD/s1424/328%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1_%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi-0X0hNU84R_6xp9UJ9KzIPHP-oWlKAdpHzluJ_ZtphXRAG0C7AzKkM-MK-nucrI0ywX7fcbaBeyl8V_P9iPgLcpUj2G8-xkHYAYEmLTYFfIABtRV1d6vbEFoL3yizBkshcTyoRCvIdfiD/w450-h640/328%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1_%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><div><span face=\"&quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif\"><b>台文通訊BONG報328期，2021年7月出刊。</b></span></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d;\">線上捐款(定期定額)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2FfF5bhx&amp;h=AT1fIGbvLe-H1RfIAEmaBwSoHSud2mWn8lrfo0xPDXLyCEJ6_oyPKdt-VNpBwe2ie9QCjJZfObjdC0zbQCynJ54D2Wi_b8ZrVcDWstK8-oYv8FmldyEJo_KdoHuWC05sSueoTuSvJ5cr-p_vScPimOGX4wzN4y0tm93TSYPwa_Oy3MkFQCQALsRTZFMOuwZl3PJcYWBoT4jwc6LmmvFHGmEYyMh57UFUGaQo8oSSuqcQD7MKG6wLN7MfjP3hZh1vLhHapsOOcRjYmtcIPyZgahNTgWaTFPQekTNcLnwDRhPn5DUPgyHeN0NWy-eAvWaf1orAzEnaT0bXGSBh6WL5ZAg_4sea_VdaRcccV0V-eEdDhNVVJKe0z-BljR9iJL_jWIDn2Jg-L_StZx71NBmaz7xd3VsLzNHGj2fO28pTvMz9QEOhl9nJrC80TCbPW5QlyDfD0ZK9o_8n3YOoDoX6PLV_4rNk2cvzW43qFquAkjfncrxhxCKH-VY6Kf7T3qxnHFKyq5jaEBd-Gzbx3BOuAS0L2ZAq5p4l1ciYXkt6XOQM7lnaWciPYKDMH73hsYXjsMWMXsK2AWmIxmqDhr3